# Pinned versions for the Hypit + Ollama replication kit (verified 2026-11-04).
# install.sh and verify.sh source this file when it sits next to them.
# OLLAMA_MODEL: a fixed tag (e.g. qwen3:1.7b) installs identically everywhere;
# set it to "auto" (or pass --auto-model to install.sh) to pick the qwen3 size
# by the machine's RAM/GPU instead — see select-model.sh and 使用手册.md §4.1.
